<%#
  Uploading from the console.

  This is how a MERCHANT gets a logo and a storefront photo: merchants are not
  self-serve in v0 — admin onboards them (MerchantPolicy) — so without this
  field the photo-led customer home has no photographs at all, on a platform
  whose first design rule is "a photo sells and explains where a description
  cannot" (AFGHAN_UX.md §1).
%>
<div class="field-unit__label">
  <%= f.label field.attribute %>
</div>
<div class="field-unit__field">
  <%= f.file_field field.attribute %>
  <% if field.attached? %>
    <p style="color:#666; font-size: 0.85em;">
      currently: <%= field.filename %> — choosing a file replaces it
    </p>
  <% end %>
</div>
